# cmdchamp shellcheck config
# SC2155: declare and assign separately — too noisy for local vars
# SC2178: nameref `questions` array vs string — shellcheck can't follow `local -n` (30 false positives in gen_level*)
# SC2016: literal `$` in single-quoted question strings — intentional, not a missing expansion
# SC2004: `$x` inside arithmetic — bash accepts both forms; pre-existing style
# SC2015: A && B || C — reviewed remaining sites; idempotent assignments and return-guards
# SC2329: `_save_profile() { :; }` test stub — invoked indirectly when sourced under test
disable=SC2155,SC2178,SC2016,SC2004,SC2015,SC2329
